		```haxe
		var rect1 = new Rectangle(0,0,2,5);
		rect1.inflate(2,2);
		```
		```haxe
		var rect1 = new Rectangle(0,0,2,5);
		var pt1 = new Point(2,2);
		rect1.inflatePoint(pt1);
